<%
  const title = 'Privacy Policy — Grand Aurelia Hotel & Resort';
  const metaDescription = 'How Grand Aurelia collects, uses and protects guest information on this demonstration website.';
%>
<%- include('partials/head') %>

<section class="simple-page">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="color:var(--muted);">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy <em>policy.</em></h1>
    <div class="simple-content">
      <p><strong>Last updated: November 2026.</strong> Grand Aurelia Hotel &amp; Resort is a fictional hotel created for demonstration purposes. This policy explains how the demo application handles the information you enter.</p>

      <h2>The short version</h2>
      <p>This website is a demonstration. Please do not enter real payment card details, government identifiers or sensitive personal information. Booking and enquiry data is stored in a local SQLite database on the machine running the demo and is not transmitted to a third party.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Booking details you provide: name, email address, telephone number, nationality, dates of stay, guest counts, special requests, selected room, extras and payment method.</li>
        <li>Enquiry and contact details: name, email address, telephone number, subject and message.</li>
        <li>Guest service requests: name, room number, booking reference and the details of your request.</li>
        <li>Newsletter subscriptions: email address.</li>
        <li>Demo administrator credentials and session information for the hotel dashboard.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How the information is used</h2>
      <p>Information is used solely to demonstrate the functionality of the booking engine, guest services and admin dashboard. Bookings appear in the admin area, enquiries can be reviewed and statuses updated, and the dashboard calculates demonstration statistics from the stored records.</p>

      <h2>Payments</h2>
      <p>No real payment is processed. The "demo card" option accepts any 16-digit number, a future expiry date and a three-digit CVV; these values are validated for format only and are not stored. Reservations paid at the hotel or at check-out are recorded with a pending payment status.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and sessions</h2>
      <p>The public website does not use advertising or analytics cookies. The admin dashboard uses a single session cookie to keep you signed in. The session expires after eight hours or when you sign out.</p>

      <h2>Data retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>All data lives in the local <code>data/aurelia.db</code> file. Running <code>npm run seed</code> replaces the database with fresh demonstration data. You may delete the database file at any time to remove all records; it will be recreated and seeded on the next start.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You may request that a demonstration record be removed by deleting the database file or by using the admin dashboard. Because this is a demo, no legal data-subject process applies, but we have tried to model good practice.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>"><%= settings.email %></a> or by telephone on <a href="tel:<%= settings.phone.replace(/[^+\d]/g, '') %>"><%= settings.phone %></a>. These contact details are fictional.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:34px;"><a class="text-link" href="/terms">Read the booking terms <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="icon-xs"></i></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
